menu "espix audio"

    config ESPIX_AUDIO
        bool "Audio playback (play)"
        default y
        help
            The play command: a GMF-based player (esp_audio_simple_player) that
            reads a URI -- a local file or an HTTP(S) stream -- decodes it, and
            hands PCM to the A2DP source. It is on by default where Bluetooth is.

endmenu
